OL,3,CReports of 'deliberate' fire-setting
OL,4,Con mountain as crews battle blaze
OL,6,FFire crews tackling a forest blaze in
OL,7,FRhondda Cynon Taf said they have
OL,8,Freceived reports of people
OL,9,Fdeliberately lighting fires on the
OL,10,Fmountain.
OL,12,FSouth Wales Fire and Rescue Service
OL,13,F(SWFRS) stated there were reports of
OL,14,Fdeliberate fire-setting on Monday
OL,15,Fnight (3 August). Crews have been
OL,16,Fbattling the wildfire in the
OL,17,FBlaenllechau and Ferndale area for
OL,18,Fdays.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/5
