OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1785849528
OL,3,CReports of 'deliberate' fire-setting
OL,4,Con mountain as crews battle blaze
OL,6,FOn Monday morning, the blaze on
OL,7,FLlanwonno Mountain had already spread
OL,8,Fto around 150 hectares of land - the
OL,9,Fequivalent size of about 210 football
OL,10,Fpitches. That is compared to covering
OL,11,Fmore than 20 hectares on Sunday.
OL,13,FThe wildfire remains a 'major
OL,14,Fincident' due to the size of the blaze
OL,15,Fand poor visibility levels.
OL,17,FThere are currently 135 firefighters
OL,18,Fat the scene, 20 fire engines, two
OL,19,Fspecialist wildfire teams, senior
OL,20,Fofficers, a high-volume pumping unit
OL,21,Fand drone capability.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/5
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
