CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1785849528
OL,3,CReports of 'deliberate' fire-setting
OL,4,Con mountain as crews battle blaze
OL,6,FNatural Resources Wales has secured
OL,7,Fthe deployment of a specialist
OL,8,Ffirefighting helicopter. However, poor
OL,9,Fweather conditions including low
OL,10,Fvisibility, mist, rain and forecasted
OL,11,Fthunderstorms have delayed deployment.
OL,12,FConditions are being assessed
OL,13,Fthroughout Tuesday (4 August).
OL,15,FAlthough people are not currently
OL,16,Fbeing asked to evacuate their homes, a
OL,17,Frest centre has been set up at Rhondda
OL,18,FFach Leisure Centre for residents of
OL,19,FBlaenllechau and Ferndale who are
OL,20,Fworried about the smoke caused by the
OL,21,Ffire.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/5
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
