OL,3,CReports of 'deliberate' fire-setting
OL,4,Con mountain as crews battle blaze
OL,6,FResidents are also being advised to
OL,7,Fkeep windows and doors closed where
OL,8,Fpossible.
OL,10,FIn a statement, the fire service said:
OL,11,F"Firefighters worked throughout the
OL,12,Fnight in challenging conditions to
OL,13,Ftackle the fire and protect properties.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/5
