FL,432,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1785849528
OL,3,CReports of 'deliberate' fire-setting
OL,4,Con mountain as crews battle blaze
OL,6,F"Incident commanders at the scene have
OL,7,Fconfirmed that communities in Ferndale
OL,8,Fremain well protected, with today's
OL,9,Foperational priority focused on
OL,10,Fprotecting the Cwmaman side of the
OL,11,Fmountain while continuing efforts to
OL,12,Fcontain the fire within forestry and
OL,13,Fupland areas.
OL,15,F"The incident remains a major incident
OL,16,Fdue to the ongoing scale of the
OL,17,Fwildfire and challenging conditions on
OL,18,Fthe mountain, including poor
OL,19,Fvisibility caused by today's low
OL,20,Fcloud, mist and rain."
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/5
